"Survival of the strong, Death to the weak." The heat of battle is the only place for this blade and it's weilder. No enlightenment can be gained outside of the battlefield. Weilder's of such believe that the universe was formed by conflict and in conflict it will end. The victors feasting upon the remains of their enemy. No respect or regard is given to the dead, for if they were worthy, their hearts would still pump blood through their veins and not upon the soil of the land.

