@143  = ~A strange looking Two Handed Sword with undetermined properties.~
@144  = ~Innoruuk, The Prince of Hate

"Creativity is born of destruction." is written upon the sword's hilt. This blade of pure hatred makes it weilder believe that hate is a creative force. Love and kindness are tools for those too ignorant to know what they want or too cowardly to do what is necessary to obtain it. It is only through the total disdain of your enemies that you can gain true power over them. Pity and mercy have no power when confronted with contempt and viciousness.
This blade is so foul that is lashes outward in battle, attack others with it's hatred of all. It's material is odd and not of the Prime Material Plane. The embodiment of evil flows from it like a source or force and will allow no one but evil to touch it.
Little else is truely known about the weapon other than it came from the Nine Hells from one of the Lords below. One might want to be careful if it ever came looking for it's possession.

STATISTICS:

