 Beast Master~
@167  = ~Cazic Thule, The Faceless

"Only by causing terror in others will you be sparred."  That is what is burnt into the shaft.
While holding the weapon he/she strives to suppress all hope. Fear rules their life and through fear they rule the lives of others. Pain, misery, violence, torture, living sacrifice; these are all tools of the one possed by this weapon.

STATISTICS:

