@250  = ~Moonblade~
@251  = ~This potent weapon was created by the smiths of ancient Myth Drannor. Moonblades are used in the long process of selecting a ruler for the isle of Evermeet. A Moonblade chooses its owner. Only an elf can use this blade; anyone else attempting to unsheath it will find themselves horribly burned, possibly resulting in death. This particular Moonblade gives its user a bonus to his armor class, allows the wielder to use the blade with mastery of the sword proficiency, as well as provides a number of specific resistances to cetain damage types.

