@286  = ~This is a magical book that has writing on the cover in ancient Netherese. A magical lock appears to be on the book since you can not open it up. This is some thing that is beyond your comprehension and better off given back to the Priest of Mystra.~
@287  = ~Amulet~
@288  = ~Amulet of the Learned~
